# This is a manifest-only marketplace: it references each plugin's own GitHub
# repo via the `source` block in .claude-plugin/marketplace.json and hosts no
# plugin source itself. Cloning a plugin in here creates a gitlink (a submodule
# entry with no .gitmodules), which every fresh clone then fails to resolve.
# That has happened three times — repo-retrofitter-plugin twice, then
# Claude-Handover. Plugin repos belong in
# ~/repos/github/ai-agents-and-prompts/ai-claude-plugins/<plugin-name>/
plugins/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
